    "A file changed on both sides" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "A file the device changed since Finder last showed it is not deleted. Finder puts it back with the device's version." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "A folder is deleted only with everything Finder shows in it. If the device added files to the folder since Finder last showed it, the folder and those files stay." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "A package, such as an .rtfd document or an app, can't be copied to the device: compress it into a .zip first. On the device every folder is a plain folder, so a package made there shows as a folder with its files in it. Symbolic links and aliases can't be copied to the device either; Finder shows an error for them." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "A package, such as an .rtfd or Keynote document, an app, a plug-in or a framework, is one item on the Mac but a folder on the device, so Ferry does not copy it. Control-click it, choose **Compress**, and copy the .zip instead." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
